{
  "sourceLanguage": "de",
  "strings": {
    "%@ aus dem Microsoft Store": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ from the Microsoft Store"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ depuis le Microsoft Store"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ – Einstellungen": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ – Settings"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ – Paramètres"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Abmelden": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sign out"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se déconnecter"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Abmelden …": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sign out…"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se déconnecter…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ausstempeln": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Check out"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Autostart-Einstellungen öffnen": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open startup settings"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ouvrir les paramètres de démarrage"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Beenden": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Exit"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quitter"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Beim Anmelden bei Windows im Infobereich öffnen": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open in the notification area when you sign in to Windows"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ouvrir dans la zone de notification à la connexion à Windows"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Beschreibung kopieren": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Copy description"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Deine Organisation legt fest, ob die App mit Windows startet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your organization decides whether the app starts with Windows."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Votre organisation décide si l’app démarre avec Windows."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Der API-Schlüssel konnte nicht in der Windows-Anmeldeinformationsverwaltung gespeichert werden (Fehler %lld).": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The API key couldn’t be saved in Windows Credential Manager (error %lld)."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La clé API n’a pas pu être enregistrée dans le Gestionnaire d’identification Windows (erreur %lld)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Der API-Schlüssel wird aus der Windows-Anmeldeinformationsverwaltung gelöscht. Deine Einträge in Odoo bleiben erhalten, die laufende Projektzeit wird nicht gebucht.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The API key will be deleted from Windows Credential Manager. Your entries in Odoo are kept; the running timer won’t be booked."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La clé API sera supprimée du Gestionnaire d’identification Windows. Vos saisies dans Odoo sont conservées, le minuteur en cours ne sera pas enregistré."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Der API-Schlüssel wird aus der Windows-Anmeldeinformationsverwaltung gelöscht. Deine Einträge in Odoo bleiben erhalten.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The API key will be deleted from Windows Credential Manager. Your entries in Odoo are kept."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La clé API sera supprimée du Gestionnaire d’identification Windows. Vos saisies dans Odoo sont conservées."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Die App startet dafür neu, das dauert nur wenige Sekunden. Deine Anwesenheit läuft in Odoo weiter.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app restarts for this, which only takes a few seconds. Your attendance keeps running in Odoo."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L’app redémarre pour cela, ce qui ne prend que quelques secondes. Votre présence continue dans Odoo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Die Suche nach Updates ist gescheitert.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Checking for updates failed."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La recherche de mises à jour a échoué."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Du hast die neueste Version.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You have the latest version."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vous avez la dernière version."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Eingabe übernehmen · Esc schließen": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enter choose · Esc close"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Entrée valider · Échap fermer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Einmal am Tag; eine neue Version zeigt das Fenster im Infobereich an": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Once a day; a new version shows up in the notification area window"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Une fois par jour ; une nouvelle version s’affiche dans la fenêtre de la zone de notification"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Einmal anmelden, danach erfasst du Zeiten direkt aus dem Infobereich der Taskleiste.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sign in once, then record your time right from the notification area of the taskbar."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Connectez-vous une fois, puis saisissez vos temps directement depuis la zone de notification de la barre des tâches."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Einstellungen": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Settings"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Paramètres"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Einstellungen (Strg+,)": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Settings (Ctrl+,)"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Paramètres (Ctrl+,)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Einstellungen öffnen …": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open settings…"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ouvrir les paramètres…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Einstellungen …": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Settings…"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Paramètres…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Einstempeln": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Check in"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Erneut prüfen": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Check again"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Erneut starten": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Start again"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Erneut versuchen": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Try again"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Gerade eben: Die Suche ist gescheitert.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Just now: the check failed."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "À l’instant : la recherche a échoué."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Gerade eben: Du hast die neueste Version.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Just now: you have the latest version."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "À l’instant : vous avez la dernière version."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Gerade eben: Version %@ ist verfügbar.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Just now: version %@ is available."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "À l’instant : la version %@ est disponible."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Grüner Punkt am Symbol, Projekt und Zeit im Tooltip. Läuft keine Projektzeit, bleibt das Symbol ohne Punkt.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Green dot on the icon, project and time in the tooltip. Without a running timer, the icon has no dot."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Point vert sur l’icône, projet et durée dans l’info-bulle. Sans minuteur en cours, l’icône reste sans point."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In Odoo: Profilbild oben rechts › Meine Präferenzen › Sicherheit › API-Schlüssel hinzufügen. Der Schlüssel wird in der Windows-Anmeldeinformationsverwaltung gespeichert.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In Odoo: profile picture at the top right › My Preferences › Security › Add API Key. The key is stored in Windows Credential Manager."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dans Odoo : photo de profil en haut à droite › Mes préférences › Sécurité › Ajouter une clé API. La clé est enregistrée dans le Gestionnaire d’identification Windows."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In den Windows-Einstellungen unter Apps › Autostart ausgeschaltet. Nur dort lässt es sich wieder einschalten.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Turned off in Windows Settings under Apps › Startup. It can only be turned back on there."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Désactivé dans les Paramètres Windows sous Applications › Démarrage. Il ne peut être réactivé que là."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Infobereich der Taskleiste": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Notification area"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zone de notification"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Installieren": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Install"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Installer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Jetzt suchen": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Check now"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Laufende Projektzeit am Symbol zeigen": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Show running timer on the icon"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Afficher le minuteur en cours sur l’icône"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Laufende Zeit": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Running timer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mit Windows starten": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Start with Windows"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Démarrer avec Windows"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nach Updates suchen …": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Check for updates…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Neu anmelden": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sign in again"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nächster Tag (Alt+→)": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Next day (Alt+→)"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jour suivant (Alt+→)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Siehst du das Uhrsymbol nicht in der Taskleiste, liegt es hinter dem Pfeil im Infobereich. Zieh es von dort auf die Taskleiste, dann bleibt es sichtbar.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If you don’t see the clock icon on the taskbar, it’s behind the arrow in the notification area. Drag it from there onto the taskbar to keep it visible."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Si vous ne voyez pas l’icône d’horloge dans la barre des tâches, elle se trouve derrière la flèche de la zone de notification. Faites-la glisser de là vers la barre des tâches pour qu’elle reste visible."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Später": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Later"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Plus tard"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Startseite: Varianten für den Kopfbereich": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Home page: header variants"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Page d’accueil : variantes de l’en-tête"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stoppen und buchen": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Stop and book"
          }
        }
